      "content": "hey i'm trying to run this macro for our monthly reconciliation but it keeps crashing. i keep getting \"Run-time error '1004': Application-defined or object-defined error\" on this line:\n\nSub MonthlyReport()\nDim ws As Worksheet\nSet ws = ThisWorkbook.Sheets(\"Reconciliation_Final\")\nws.Range(\"A1\").Value = \"Monthly Summary\"\nws.Columns(\"A:Z\").AutoFit\nws.Range(\"B2:B10\").Select\nSelection.Copy\nws.Range(\"C2\").PasteSpecial Paste:=xlPasteValues\nEnd Sub\n\ncan u tell me what the issue is? it was working fine last month.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
